Right-to-left text for AnkiNX (Persian, Arabic, Hebrew cards): litehtml lays
words out left to right only. line_box::finish() now reorders each line's
words like the Unicode bidi algorithm does for plain text (runs of
right-to-left words reversed; dir="rtl" on an ancestor makes the line read
right to left and turns left alignment into right). Shaping and the order
inside each word are done by the container (app/src/view/rtl_text.cpp).

